}

:: StoryInit
<<set $inventory = []>>
<<set $clues = []>>
<<set $bellRings = false>>
<<set $foundNote = false>>
<<set $sawPortrait = false>>
<<set $sawClock = false>>
<<set $sawCrate = false>>
<<set $deskOpen = false>>
<<set $elevatorUnlocked = false>>
<<set $deskCodeInput = "">>

:: UIWidgets [widget]
<<widget "addItem">>
<<if !$inventory.includes(_args[0])>>
  <<run $inventory.push(_args[0])>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "addClue">>
<<if !$clues.includes(_args[0])>>
  <<run $clues.push(_args[0])>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: StoryCaption
[[🏠 Main Menu->Start]]

''🎒 Inventory:''
<<if $inventory.length is 0>>
- Empty
<<else>>
<<for _item range $inventory>>
- <<= _item>>
<</for>>
<</if>>

''🧩 Clues:''
<<if $clues.length is 0>>
- None yet
<<else>>
<<for _clue range $clues>>
- <<= _clue>>
<</for>>
<</if>>

:: StoryStyles [stylesheet]
.passage {
  max-width: 760px;
  animation: passageFadeIn 280ms ease-out;
}

@keyframes passageFadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

body {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(94, 106, 126, 0.18), transparent 36%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 90%, rgba(123, 95, 73, 0.16), transparent 36%),
    #0f1115;
}

.menu-board,
.room-map {
  border: 1px solid #3b4350;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 0.85rem;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #161a22 0%, #11151d 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
}

.menu-board ul {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  padding-left: 1.15rem;
}

.room-map table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
}

.room-map td {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0.6rem;
  border: 1px dashed #2d3440;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
}

.room-map .map-link {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
}

.room-map .map-link:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.room-map .map-conservatory {
  background: rgba(105, 175, 132, 0.15);
  border-color: rgba(105, 175, 132, 0.45);
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(105, 175, 132, 0.2);
}

.room-map .map-study {
  background: rgba(195, 169, 106, 0.15);
  border-color: rgba(195, 169, 106, 0.45);
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(195, 169, 106, 0.2);
}

.room-map .map-service {
  background: rgba(136, 184, 191, 0.15);
  border-color: rgba(136, 184, 191, 0.45);
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(136, 184, 191, 0.2);
}

.room-map .map-guest {
  background: rgba(169, 149, 199, 0.15);
  border-color: rgba(169, 149, 199, 0.45);
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(169, 149, 199, 0.2);
}

.room-map .blank {
  border-color: transparent;
  background: transparent;
}

.room-map strong {
  color: #cfd7e6;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.link-internal {
  color: #a9d0ff;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(169, 208, 255, 0.45);
}

.link-internal:hover {
  color: #d0e5ff;
  border-bottom-color: rgba(208, 229, 255, 0.9);
}

.room-accent {
  margin: 0.25rem 0 0.8rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
  border-left: 4px solid #7188ab;
  background: rgba(27, 34, 47, 0.6);
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.accent-foyer { border-left-color: #8ea2c7; }
.accent-study { border-left-color: #c3a96a; }
.accent-conservatory { border-left-color: #69af84; }
.accent-service { border-left-color: #88b8bf; }
.accent-guest { border-left-color: #a995c7; }
.accent-freight { border-left-color: #c18484; }

.badge-row {
  margin: 0.6rem 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.45rem;
}

.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  animation: badgePop 220ms ease-out;
}

.badge-clue {
  background: rgba(120, 180, 255, 0.14);
  border-color: rgba(120, 180, 255, 0.45);
}

.badge-item {
  background: rgba(255, 205, 120, 0.14);
  border-color: rgba(255, 205, 120, 0.45);
}

@keyframes badgePop {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.94);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
  }
}

:: Start
The house has a slate board in the front hall.

<div class="menu-board">
<strong>Choose a door:</strong>
<ul>
<li>[[🚪 Door 1: The Quiet Floor->Quiet Floor]]</li>
<li>[[🚪 Door 2: Locked for now 🔒->Door 2 Locked]]</li>
<li>[[🚪 Door 3: Locked for now 🔒->Door 3 Locked]]</li>
</ul>
</div>

:: Door 2 Locked
Door 2 does not move when you pull the handle.

A brass tag reads: "Under construction."

[[Back to door list->Start]]

:: Door 3 Locked
Door 3 is sealed with painted-over screws.

Someone penciled beside it: "Come back later."

[[Back to door list->Start]]

:: Quiet Floor
<div class="room-accent accent-guest">🛏️ Guest Room</div>

The bell has not rung yet, but you can feel it in the walls.

You wake in a small guest room with no windows, only a brass plaque:

''GUEST ROOM - QUIET FLOOR''

A folded note is pinned to the door with a silver nail.

<<if !$foundNote>>
[[📝 Read the note->Read Note]]
<</if>>
[[🚶 Step into the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Read Note
The paper smells faintly of smoke and rain.

"If you are reading this, the house accepted you.
Find Ada before the Bell.
Do not trust the mirrors.
- E"

<<set $foundNote = true>>
<<addClue "A note signed only 'E'.">>

<div class="badge-row">
  <span class="badge badge-clue">🧩 Clue Added: Note from E</span>
</div>

[[🚶 Go to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Foyer
<div class="room-accent accent-foyer">🧭 Foyer</div>

A circular foyer sits at the center of this floor.

You orient yourself by direction instead of door labels.

<div class="room-map">
<strong>Floor Map</strong>
<table>
  <tr>
    <td class="blank"></td>
    <td><span class="map-link map-conservatory">[[🌿 Conservatory->Conservatory]]</span></td>
    <td class="blank"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="map-link map-study">[[📚 Study->Study]]</span></td>
    <td><strong>Foyer</strong></td>
    <td><span class="map-link map-service">[[🔧 Service Hall->Service Hall]]</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="blank"></td>
    <td><span class="map-link map-guest">[[🛏️ Guest Room->Quiet Floor]]</span></td>
    <td class="blank"></td>
  </tr>
</table>
</div>

A tall portrait watches from above the stairs.

[[🖼️ Inspect Portrait->Portrait]]

:: Portrait
<div class="room-accent accent-foyer">🖼️ Portrait Landing</div>

The brass plate under the portrait reads:

"''SEVEN'' guests entered Aster House in 1924.
Only one left with a name."

<<if !$sawPortrait>>
<<set $sawPortrait = true>>
<<addClue "Portrait plate emphasizes SEVEN.">>
<div class="badge-row">
  <span class="badge badge-clue">🧩 Clue Added: Seven guests</span>
</div>
<</if>>

[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Study
<div class="room-accent accent-study">📚 Study</div>

Dust hangs in sheets. A roll-top desk sits against the wall.

<<if $deskOpen>>
The desk stands open. A hidden compartment is empty.
[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]
<<else>>
A keypad has been added to the antique lock. Three digits.

<<if $sawPortrait and $sawClock and $sawCrate>>
You have enough fragments to test a full code.

The house gave you three signs: the frozen time, the watcher above, and the freight mark.
<</if>>

Code: <<textbox "$deskCodeInput" "" autofocus>>

<<button "Try code 🔢">>
  <<if $deskCodeInput is "873">>
    <<set $deskOpen = true>>
    <<addItem "Brass Service Key">>
    <<addClue "Desk letter: 'The Bell is not a clock. It is a person.'">>
    <<goto "Desk Open">>
  <<else>>
    <<goto "Desk Fail">>
  <</if>>
<</button>>

[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]
<</if>>

:: Desk Fail
The lock flashes red once, then goes dark.

The house hums, as if amused.

[[Try again->Study]]
[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Desk Open
The lock clicks.

Inside:
- A brass key tagged "SERVICE ELEVATOR"
- A torn letter in Ada's handwriting

"The Bell keeps the floor plans in people, not paper.
If I disappear, follow the freight line down."

<div class="badge-row">
  <span class="badge badge-item">🎒 Item Added: Brass Service Key</span>
  <span class="badge badge-clue">🧩 Clue Added: The Bell is a person</span>
</div>

[[🗝️ Take everything and return to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Conservatory
<div class="room-accent accent-conservatory">🌿 Conservatory</div>

The glass ceiling is cracked but dry. Dead vines coil around iron benches.

At the center, a frozen station clock still reads ''8:17''.

<<if !$sawClock>>
<<set $sawClock = true>>
<<addClue "Conservatory clock stopped at 8:17.">>
<div class="badge-row">
  <span class="badge badge-clue">🧩 Clue Added: Time stopped at 8:17</span>
</div>
<</if>>

You hear faint knocking from inside a sealed wall.

[[🧱 Examine the sealed wall->Sealed Wall]]
[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Sealed Wall
You press your ear to the plaster.

Three knocks. Pause. Three knocks.

Not random. A signal.

<<addClue "Knock pattern: 3 - pause - 3.">>

[[Back to the conservatory->Conservatory]]

:: Service Hall
<div class="room-accent accent-service">🔧 Service Hall</div>

Pipes run along the ceiling. At the end of the hall waits a caged service elevator.

A wooden freight crate sits nearby, stenciled with a faded number: ''3''.

<<if !$sawCrate>>
<<set $sawCrate = true>>
<<addClue "Freight crate marked 3.">>
<div class="badge-row">
  <span class="badge badge-clue">🧩 Clue Added: Crate mark 3</span>
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $elevatorUnlocked>>
The elevator gate is open.
[[⬇️ Descend to the freight level->Freight Level]]
[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]
<<else>>
<<if $inventory.includes("Brass Service Key")>>
You fit the brass key into the elevator lock.

<<button "Unlock the service elevator 🔓">>
  <<set $elevatorUnlocked = true>>
  <<goto "Elevator Unlock">>
<</button>>
<<else>>
The elevator lock has no keypad. It needs a key.
<</if>>

[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]
<</if>>

:: Elevator Unlock
The gate rattles open.

A fresh card has been tied to the control lever:

"FREIGHT LEVEL - OCCUPANT: ADA MARROW"

The ink is still wet.

[[⬇️ Descend->Freight Level]]
[[Back to the foyer->Foyer]]

:: Freight Level
<div class="room-accent accent-freight">⬇️ Freight Level</div>

The elevator drops too far.

When it stops, you step into a corridor of unfinished walls and numbered doors.
The guest room mark is here too.

At the far end, a woman in a bellhop coat waits under a bare light.
She smiles like she has been expecting you.

"You took your time," she says.
"Now tell me: which name did the house give you?"

''End of Chapter 1 starter.''

[[🔄 Restart->Start Over]]

:: Start Over
<<set $inventory = []>>
<<set $clues = []>>
<<set $bellRings = false>>
<<set $foundNote = false>>
<<set $sawPortrait = false>>
<<set $sawClock = false>>
<<set $sawCrate = false>>
<<set $deskOpen = false>>
<<set $elevatorUnlocked = false>>
<<set $deskCodeInput = "">>
<<goto "Start">>

[[Wake up in the Guest Room->Start]]
